  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e01-scene-19",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "把门关上！  (Close the Door!)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In pain from his chronic stomach trouble, Chun Yuqiao calls out from his office to shut the door. Bu Xiaogu steps inside to close it — and promptly gets ordered back out into the corridor. Listen first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "出了点问题，我解决一下。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "关门，关门！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "谁让你进来的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您没事吧？我是布小谷。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我说的关门，是在外边把门关上。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "出去！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你在这儿干吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不是说过实习生不许进总编室吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "跟你开玩笑的，说说。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's look at every line of this awkward doorway mix-up.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "出了点问题，我解决一下。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A small problem came up; I will take care of it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "关门，关门！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Close the door, close the door!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "谁让你进来的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who told you to come in?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您没事吧？我是布小谷。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you alright? I am Bu Xiaogu.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我说的关门，是在外边把门关上。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When I said close the door, I meant close it from the outside.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "出去！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Get out!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你在这儿干吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What are you doing here?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不是说过实习生不许进总编室吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did you not say interns are not allowed inside the chief editor's office?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "跟你开玩笑的，说说。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I was joking with you — go ahead and tell me.'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "出了点问题，我解决一下。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "关门，关门！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "谁让你进来的？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您没事吧？我是布小谷。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我说的关门，是在外边把门关上。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "出去！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你在这儿干吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不是说过实习生不许进总编室吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "跟你开玩笑的，说说。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Once Chun Yuqiao steps into the hallway, he actually listens to what the intern came to say. You learned \"guan men\", opposite direction pair \"jinlai\" and \"chuqu\", and \"nin meishi ba?\".",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
